1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,055
Outlook sempat mati sekitar sehari.

2
00:00:03,235 --> 00:00:05,475
Dan itu bukan karena diretas.

3
00:00:05,875 --> 00:00:07,382
Tanggal 12 November,

4
00:00:07,382 --> 00:00:09,943
server email Microsoft mulai gagal

5
00:00:09,943 --> 00:00:12,580
di pemeriksaan otomatisnya sendiri,

6
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,560
lalu offline.

7
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:17,023
Server yang tersisa kewalahan dan ikut tumbang.

8
00:00:17,203 --> 00:00:20,086
Outlook dan Teams lumpuh di seluruh dunia.

9
00:00:20,266 --> 00:00:23,498
Penyebab pastinya belum diumumkan Microsoft.

10
00:00:23,898 --> 00:00:25,183
Kalau terjadi lagi,

11
00:00:25,183 --> 00:00:27,484
cek dulu halaman status Microsoft.

12
00:00:27,664 --> 00:00:29,836
Siap-siap email telat masuk.

13
00:00:30,016 --> 00:00:30,926
Yang mendesak,

14
00:00:30,926 --> 00:00:33,202
pindahkan ke telepon atau WhatsApp.

15
00:00:33,602 --> 00:00:35,089
Perlu pindah ke Google?

16
00:00:35,269 --> 00:00:35,636
Bisa,

17
00:00:35,636 --> 00:00:37,763
tapi Google juga pernah down,

18
00:00:37,763 --> 00:00:40,257
dan migrasi satu kantor itu mahal.

19
00:00:40,437 --> 00:00:42,816
Rencana cadangan jauh lebih murah.

20
00:00:43,216 --> 00:00:46,501
Kita nggak bisa mencegah Microsoft gangguan,

21
00:00:46,501 --> 00:00:49,265
tapi bisa menjaga bisnis tetap jalan.

22
00:00:49,445 --> 00:00:51,603
Tentukan jalur komunikasi kedua,

23
00:00:51,603 --> 00:00:54,098
simpan kontak penting secara offline,

24
00:00:54,098 --> 00:00:55,986
dan latih rencananya sekali.

25
00:00:56,386 --> 00:00:59,203
Kantor kamu ngapain waktu Outlook mati?

26
00:00:59,203 --> 00:01:00,503
Tulis di komentar.
